      description 'src/lib/ui: Table, one editor per registered field type, Palette, Panel, Rail, Badge, Sparkline and roc icons over dark-first LCH tokens on a 4px grid, with no per-component font size or colour literal anywhere. Table columns and fact-sheet sections are driven by field definitions, so a field added by ongoing field add renders and edits with no frontend change. The house style and its deliberate drift from the Linear patterns are written down in DESIGN.md. Replaced dashboard.css, the catalog ticker, the header flyout, the project drawer, and drag reorder.'
      metadata { uid 'inventory.ui_kit' fractalColor '#759EB5' evidence ['src/lib/ui/tokens.css', 'src/lib/ui/Table.svelte', 'src/lib/ui/FieldEditor.svelte', 'DESIGN.md', 'docs/adr/0008-frontend-design-system.md'] }
